        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(g) In the event an Employee who cancels a \"Payroll Deduction Authorization,\" in accordance with the above paragraph, wishes to resume deductions for amounts equal to Union Dues, such employee shall be obligated to complete a new \"Payroll Deduction Authorization.\"",
