            "block_content": "(h) By written certification, the Union shall keep Lucent Technologies Inc. currently informed of the amount of regular monthly dues lawfully in effect in each Local having jurisdiction over any Employees in the bargaining unit. Such amount or formula shall be uniform for all Employees represented by the Local.",
